{"text":"So, the question then becomes why is it that such a good idea, such great intentions of giving money to African countries actually is fraught with problems? Why is it that we're seeing higher levels of poverty, we're seeing Africa shear off in terms of growth, what is the problem? And also with respect to growth, the United Nations, just in terms of a target, has said that we need African countries to grow at around 7% a year in order to meaningfully put a dent in poverty. The reality is that African countries are growing now, for this year, projected, IMF projections are more like a 1.9, maybe 2%. I'm going to very quickly go through some of the reasons why aid doesn't work. I'm getting my four-minute signal over there. I'm not going to tell you all of them, because I want you to go and buy the book, but...","words":[{"text":"So","start":0.0,"end":0.72,"punct":","},{"text":"the","start":0.72,"end":0.88},{"text":"question","start":0.88,"end":1.1},{"text":"then","start":1.1,"end":1.34},{"text":"becomes","start":1.34,"end":1.7},{"text":"why","start":1.7,"end":2.2},{"text":"is","start":2.2,"end":2.54},{"text":"it","start":2.54,"end":2.7},{"text":"that","start":2.7,"end":2.86},{"text":"such","start":2.86,"end":3.06},{"text":"a","start":3.06,"end":3.2},{"text":"good","start":3.2,"end":3.6},{"text":"idea","start":3.6,"end":4.2,"punct":","},{"text":"such","start":4.4,"end":4.5},{"text":"great","start":4.5,"end":4.94},{"text":"intentions","start":4.94,"end":5.58},{"text":"of","start":5.58,"end":5.8},{"text":"giving","start":5.8,"end":6.02},{"text":"money","start":6.02,"end":6.48},{"text":"to","start":6.48,"end":7.5},{"text":"African","start":7.5,"end":8.3},{"text":"countries","start":8.3,"end":8.88},{"text":"actually","start":8.88,"end":9.62},{"text":"is","start":9.62,"end":9.92},{"text":"fraught","start":9.92,"end":10.26},{"text":"with","start":10.26,"end":10.56},{"text":"problems","start":10.56,"end":10.94,"punct":"?"},{"text":"Why","start":11.22,"end":11.48},{"t